## How to Find Information

### Old Way (Deprecated):
```bash
# Read entire catalog (45K tokens)
cat docs/DATASET_CATALOG.md | grep -A50 "### TableBank"
```

### New Way:
```bash
# Read specific dataset (1-2K tokens)
cat docs/datasets/source/tablebank.md

# Or find by task (2-3K tokens)
cat docs/datasets/indices/TABLES.md
```

